  "releaseNotes": "Directly supported lengths use Accelerate interleaved or split-complex execution, while unsupported exact lengths use provider-assisted Bluestein. Convolution and correlation may use union-selected padded lengths, and separable two-dimensional composition is supported. Rader orchestration and direct native 2D transforms remain deferred.",
